"Vethedya is the Artonan capital on the Mother, hailed as capital of the known universe."
"Its teleport alcove is a nonagon-shaped room with a lustrous pearl-white floor."
"The alcove's walls and ceiling show realistic sky: clouds by day, a starry dark by night."
"Teleports into the capital are routed through that alcove."
"Vethedya lies south of Rapport I, a little later in the day, and its skyline shows across fields."
"The Grove of the Thoughtful, Healer Yenu-pezth's House of Healing, lies outside the city."
"The Sdyelis Branch, a vast oasis ship, is being built in the forest near the road there."
"Its sky-view teleport alcove is called the Sky Chamber."
